WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.497
Nadia builds the forms her field teams fill in.

2
00:00:05.497 --> 00:00:09.258
The Forms page lists each one, the indicator it writes to,

3
00:00:09.258 --> 00:00:11.592
and how many responses have come in.

4
00:00:12.041 --> 00:00:14.954
The Kurigram team now visits families at home,

5
00:00:14.954 --> 00:00:17.424
to see why some children miss sessions.

6
00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:19.578
They need a form for those visits.

7
00:00:19.994 --> 00:00:23.702
She starts a new form, gives it a name, and picks the project.

8
00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:31.554
A short description tells the field officer when to use it.

9
00:00:35.183 --> 00:00:36.884
The builder has three columns.

10
00:00:36.884 --> 00:00:39.604
Field types on the left, the form in the middle,

11
00:00:39.604 --> 00:00:42.609
and the settings for the selected field on the right.

12
00:00:43.023 --> 00:00:46.930
The first question is a number that counts toward an indicator.

13
00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.038
She adds an Indicator value field.

14
00:00:50.232 --> 00:00:53.149
Then she chooses which indicator it writes to:

15
00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:55.939
pupils attending community learning centres.

16
00:00:55.939 --> 00:00:59.681
Every answer goes to Review as a figure for that indicator.

17
00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:02.311
Next, a yes or no question.

18
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.290
Then a single choice: the main reason a child misses sessions.

19
00:01:21.422 --> 00:01:22.879
She adds Other as well.

20
00:01:22.879 --> 00:01:26.934
When someone picks Other, the form asks them to say what it was,

21
00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:29.089
so the answer is never left vague.

22
00:01:29.497 --> 00:01:31.257
Last, a photo as evidence.

23
00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:35.522
She limits it to photos, since that is what the visit produces.

24
00:01:38.261 --> 00:01:41.818
Preview shows the form the way a field officer will see it.

25
00:01:43.867 --> 00:01:44.816
It looks right.

26
00:01:44.816 --> 00:01:47.346
She goes back to editing, and publishes.

27
00:01:52.001 --> 00:01:55.047
Once it is published, the form has a public link.

28
00:01:55.047 --> 00:01:58.591
Field officers can open it on a phone without an account.

29
00:01:59.005 --> 00:02:03.231
She copies the link, ready to send to the Kurigram team on WhatsApp.

30
00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:08.057
From now on, every visit they record goes to Review, and once approved,

31
00:02:08.057 --> 00:02:10.470
the numbers count toward the indicator.
